# 2D L-shape on the unit square, with a square notch cut from the upper-right.
# Outer boundary traversed counterclockwise.
#
#  (0,1) ────── (0.5,1)
#    │            │
#    │            └──── (0.5, 0.5) ─── (1, 0.5)
#    │                                    │
#    │                                    │
#  (0,0) ────────────────────────────── (1,0)

v 0.0 0.0 0.0
v 1.0 0.0 0.0
v 1.0 0.5 0.0
v 0.5 0.5 0.0
v 0.5 1.0 0.0
v 0.0 1.0 0.0

l 1 2 3 4 5 6 1
